Mon Jul 27 07:03:49 UTC 2026 - Martin Hauke <mardnh@gmx.de>

- Update to version 5.5.0
  Better Audio Experience
  * Smoother Listening: Improved handling of audio drops and
    glitches during poor reception.
  * Reliable Playback: Optimized how audio starts and is buffered.
  Modern Look & Feel
  * New Visual Theme: Updated the application with a fresh, modern
    blueish design.
  * Enhanced Indicators: Redesigned status meters and visual
    elements.
  * Better Information: Added helpful tooltips and clearer labels.
  Improved Usability
  * Click-to-Jump Navigation: You can now click anywhere on a
    slider to jump directly to that position.
  * Easy-Access Info: A new information window to view version
    details and related library information.
  Performance & Stability
  * Under-the-Hood Improvements: General maintenance and
    optimizations.

