Mon Jul 13 07:19:07 UTC 2026 - Martin Hauke <mardnh@gmx.de>

- Update to version 5.4.0
  * Make TII accumulation time independent of the signal level.
  * Updated softbit detection.
  * Show the phase of the decoded PRS.
  * Also show the unwrapped phase of the decoded PRS in the
    carrier spectrum scope.
  * Provide slide show picture download progress bar.
  * Improved scaling calculations for grid lines and ticks in the
    scopes.
  * Cleaned up the GUI and made some colors slightly brighter.
  * Implemented a better strategy for avoiding audio buffer
    underruns and overruns.
  * Added packet-loss concealment for AAC decoders.
  * Many other code cleanups.

